<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed sharply lower Thursday in quiet trading.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 64.73 to 5647.65.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite fell 3.43 to 353.36.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.37.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1627 to 743.</p>
<p>Volume was 321,092,760, compared with 296,382,010 Wednesday.</p>
